WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:04.580
Biochemistrypedia is a free biology site.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.980
It starts where you are.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.620
A five-year-old and a grown-up can plant a seed and watch it wake up.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.100
A seventh grader can find out what is inside a cell.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.100
A college student can read the experiment that settled a question.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.940
Every lesson explains its idea at more than one level.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.080
Step down when you need to.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.160
Climb back up when you're ready.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.210
In the school courses,

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:37.570
a switch lets each student choose how much help they get.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.570
The task stays the same.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.350
Lessons come with short films, simulations you can change,

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.210
and questions that explain their answers.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:51.020
And the courses keep going, past what is settled,

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:53.780
to questions nobody has answered yet.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.540
No account.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.960
No advertising.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.570
Find your rung, and start climbing.
